  "description": "Strale agent skills with remote MCP connector for Strale platform integration.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `strale` (Use Strale to access verified, quality-scored data capabilities — company registries, financial validation, compliance checks, and more), `strale-lobehub` (Access 225+ verified data capabilities through Strale — the trust layer for AI agents), `strale-openclaw` (Verified data capabilities for your agent — company data, compliance checks, financial validation, and more)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install strale@claude-community` from `strale-io/agent-skills`.",
